#DuplicateEmployeeException
Used when a duplicate employee ID is entered.

# EmployeeNotFoundException
Used when an employee with the given ID does not exist.



## 11. Command-Line Execution

The project is designed to run directly from a terminal without requiring a graphical interface.

The Java source file containing the public `Main` class should be saved as:

